  "description": "Lightweight at Just 20 lbs\nThe CORSA T24 is a lightweight 24-inch bike built with an aluminum alloy frame, Shimano CUES 9-speed drivetrain, and Tektro V-brakes. Weighing approximately 20 lbs, it's easy to handle, whether you're riding around the neighborhood, heading to the park, or taking it along for a weekend outing.\nThe 9-speed drivetrain lets riders adjust their pedaling effort on flat roads and gentle hills, while the Tektro V-brakes provide controlled stopping power.\nWith its lightweight frame, internal cable routing, and practical components, the T24 is a good choice for riders looking for a smaller bike that's easy to manage.\nKey Features\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame: Weighs approximately 20 lbs, making the bike easier to lift, carry, and handle.\n\nInternal Cable Routing: Cables are routed through the frame for a cleaner, more streamlined appearance.\n\nShimano CUES 9-Speed: Nine gears for comfortable pedaling on flat roads and moderate inclines.\n\nTektro V-Brakes: Front and rear rim brakes with straightforward adjustment and maintenance.\n\n24-Inch Wheels: A compact wheel size for riders who prefer a smaller bicycle.\n\nFlat Handlebars: A familiar hand position with easy access to the brake levers and shifter.",
